invariant: INV-38
file: srv_flight.h
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: the server sends its own record_size_limit in the
  EncryptedExtensions to a hello that offered none, an extension response
  RFC 9846 §4.3 forbids (rfc9846.txt:1582-1587). Every rustls client
  aborts the handshake on it
  (https://github.com/c4milo/chapulin/issues/206).
  test_flight_record_size_limit_reply reads the message for a hello
  without the extension.

--- old
    if (ch->record_size_limit == 0) {
        h->record_size_limit = 0;
    }
--- new
